<title>NETHERLANDS: ING sets 1996 stock div at one per 66.</title>
<headline>ING sets 1996 stock div at one per 66.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial services group ING said on Tuesday it had set its 1996 optional final stock dividend at one new share per 66 held.</p>
<p>In April, ING announced it would pay a 1996 cash dividend of 2.00 guilders, of which 0.83 had already been paid as an interim dividend. The final payment could be taken up in cash or as an alternative dividend in new shares.</p>
<p>ING shares closed at 79.30 guilders on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange on Tuesday, up 0.50 from their previous close.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 (fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
